cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "UST-Fuse Cyber Range Digital Twin"
abstract: >-
  A budget, virtual-first digital twin of the UST-Fuse hybrid multi-sensor UAV
  detection and tracking range. It emulates radar / EO-IR / RF-SDR / acoustic
  sensors, time synchronisation, network transport and fault injection; runs two
  fusion pipelines (naive Reference vs Full UST-Fuse) over identical immutable
  RAW data; provides a multi-target Kalman tracker, a metrics engine (detection,
  tracking, calibration, paired statistics), a visualisation suite and
  field-trial style reports, with full experiment provenance for reproducibility.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-06
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/omega2417/bnt"
keywords:
